    {
      "id": "claim_0519db6c8eb44ffdbae8780805e4b1c3",
      "statement": "bin/pi is the only host-side code in the repository and is written in POSIX sh without arrays or bash-only builtins, which is why it hand-rolls a symlink walk instead of using readlink -f to find the repository root through the make install symlink.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://bin/pi#L1-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:19de761c64eb82685449a917e238ae095fbcd18bc9c8103f8e86bb842c5881bc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://bin/pi#L19-L27",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bb7169c70277e857f02ee3b40e8c5da737dd2684c71070b87dfb0867ec2e55b6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0dd9ec736634434d8741f32b808b2569",
      "statement": "The launcher resolves both image names from the environment (PI_IMAGE defaulting to pi-agent:latest, SUPERMEMORY_IMAGE to supermemory-server:local) and re-exports them so Compose resolves the same names the launcher inspected.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://bin/pi#L116-L117",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:011459e67f4fb8791325d3a2258cb633021d6c200035496b72875369dd23cee4:"
        },
        {
