      "statement": "The launcher ends by exporting PROJECT_DIR, AGENT_DIR, PI_IMAGE and SUPERMEMORY_IMAGE and execing docker compose run --rm with the mode and leftover agent arguments, leaving tty and user unquoted so an empty value vanishes as an argument.",
